{"code":"214390","name":"경보제약","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1987년 원료의약품 전문회사로 설립, 2002년 완제의약품으로 사업을 확장, 2015년 유가증권시장에 상장함. 원료의약품 부문에서는 세파계 항생제, 항암제 API를 16개국에 수출하고, 완제의약품 부문에서는 순환기 약물, 흡입마취제 등 판매하고 있음. 동사는 ADC 항암제 접합기술 및 Payload-Linker 기술을 자체 개발하고, ADC 전용공장 건설 등 글로벌 시장 진출을 준비하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":5270.0,"open":5240.0,"high":5880.0,"low":5170.0,"volume":9201,"amount":48489270.0,"ret_1d":2.9297,"gap":2.3438,"range_pct":13.4725,"ret_5":-2.0446,"ret_20":-4.529,"ret_60":5.5055,"ret_120":-22.5,"ret_250":-12.1667,"ma20":5343.0,"ma60":5328.5,"ma120":5435.1667,"ma200":5801.45,"close_vs_ma200":-9.1606,"close_vs_ma60":-1.0979,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":14.4765,"r2_60":0.1335,"slope_120":-21.0544,"r2_120":0.2333,"slope_250":-16.0284,"r2_250":0.2124,"high52":9300.0,"low52":4700.0,"pos_52w":12.3913,"dd_52w":-43.3333,"mdd_1y":-42.1637,"atr14_pct":6.7634,"vol_ann_60":22.3697,"vol_avg20":18432.4,"vol_ratio20":0.4992,"vr5":0.7032,"vr20":0.1751,"amount_avg5":97768104.0,"amount_avg20":98264118.0,"amount_avg60":133291398.0,"obv_chg20":-36.444,"turnover_20":1.542,"pv_eff_20":-2.9371,"rsi14":46.7328,"frgn_net_5":3808.0,"inst_net_5":147.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0159,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0006,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0165,"frgn_net_20":24678.0,"inst_net_20":1131.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.1032,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0047,"smart_net_20_pct":0.108,"frgn_net_60":-37471.0,"inst_net_60":-9617.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.1567,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0402,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.197,"frgn_net_120":183782.0,"inst_net_120":-36959.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.7687,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.1546,"smart_net_120_pct":0.6141,"foreign_ratio":2.36,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.12,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":9.0,"op_margin_q":1.1968,"op_qoq":28.5714,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-62.5,"rev_yoy":15.1608,"op_trend_4q":21.5385,"fin_period":"202606","roe":3.49,"debt_ratio":150.06,"per":24.98,"pbr":0.86,"div_yiel